                <pb facs="0985" n="865" xml:id="pg865"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister of Foreign Affairs of
                    Norway.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Government of Sweden, through its legation at Washington, having officially
                    informed the Government of the United States of the King’s renunciation of crown
                    of Norway for himself and his house and his recognition of Norway as entirely
                    separated from Sweden, I shall be pleased to receive Mr. Ch. Hauge as chargé
                    d’affaires of Norway, as you request in your telegram of October 29.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
